 "notes": "All 12 planned kinds kept (no old data). Tier lists built from fetched Wikipedia/maker pages and one independent taste test (Tasting Table orange-juice test: Naked winner, Tropicana runner-up). Archetypes only for named icons: Welch's Concord, Ocean Spray Cranberry Juice Cocktail, V8, Capri-Sun, Hi-C, SunnyD. Left out: Suja/Pressed/Evolution Fresh (no page retrieved; Suja wiki 404), OKF aloe (only retail snippets), Dole juice (no confirming page), named birch/maple water brands (none on fetched pages), Which?/Consumer Reports winners (not found). No regional style archetypes (blood orange, nimbu pani) as bottled-product icons could be confirmed, so they are types."
